  "releaseNotes": "Alpha. Documentation only: no behaviour change, and the compiled library is the alpha.7 library. The package READMEs are titled libtmux for .NET and state the alpha terms every libtmux port states. Install instructions use the noun-first dotnet package add. Ten false XML documentation comments are corrected and the rest cut to the constraint they carry, which changes the text IntelliSense shows without changing what the code does. The public API is not settled and may change without notice between prereleases; pin an exact version. Full history: https://github.com/libtmux/libtmux-dotnet/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
